      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed mechanism simultaneously enables low density, high strength, corrosion resistance, and high-temperature oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Above approximately 1000 °C, increased diffusion overrides the moderating effect of lattice distortion.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Above approximately 1000 °C, increased diffusion disrupts the protective oxide scale.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Above approximately 1000 °C, increased diffusion diminishes mechanical properties.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thermal annealing reduces lattice distortion in the proposed Al–Cr–Fe–Co–Ni baseline.",
